e="renderApp()&lt;br&gt;bootstrap 與每次 hashchange 呼叫" style="ellipse;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="110" width="210" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="r1" value="舊網址轉址 replaceState&lt;br&gt;#account→#settings/account 等" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="222" width="210" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="r2" value="renderToken++&lt;br&gt;parseRoute(location.hash)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;src/main.ts&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="334" width="210" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="r3" value="route.module？" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="431" width="210" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b1" value="帳號：先顯示 Loading&lt;br&gt;refreshAccount() 完成後&lt;br&gt;renderAccountLoaded&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;src/account/account-controller.ts&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#d5f0ea;strokeColor=#3a8f7e;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="670" width="210" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b2" value="設定：home 讀候選記憶數&lt;br&gt;memory 整理審核狀態&lt;br&gt;data 備份／偵錯&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;src/settings/views/settings-view.ts&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#d5f0ea;strokeColor=#3a8f7e;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="670" width="210" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b3" value="日報 main：對齊共用工地；從設定返回時&lt;br&gt;refreshActiveMemoryCache&lt;br&gt;history：讀近 7 日定稿；settings：refreshSettings&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;src/daily/views/daily-view.ts&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#d5f0ea;strokeColor=#3a8f7e;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="670" width="210" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b4" value="水位：動態 import controller.js&lt;br&gt;依「使用者×工地」快取 controller&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;src/water-level/water-shell.ts&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#d5f0ea;strokeColor=#3a8f7e;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="670" width="210" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b3b" value="restoreEntryScope → persistEntryDraft&lt;br&gt;輸出畫面 → applyDailyReadOnly（viewer 唯讀）" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="815.6" width="210" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m" value="app.innerHTML = 畫面 + PWA 更新提示&lt;br&gt;之後 requestAnimationFrame 畫進料連線曲線" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="1006" width="210" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n1" value="過期保護：每個 await 之後比對 renderToken，&lt;br&gt;不相符就丟棄這次渲染，避免舊結果覆蓋新頁面。&lt;br&gt;畫面 = 整頁 innerHTML 重繪；IME 組字與輸入焦點&lt;br&gt;改由各處「局部更新」特例處理。" style="shape=note;size=12;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bda63c;align=left;spacing=8;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="222" width="300" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="renderApp 約 40 行，其中設定/記憶審核分支各是 600+ 字元的單行。&lt;br&gt;建議：每個 route 對應一個 loader + view 函式（route table），renderApp 只負責 token 與掛載。" style="shape=note;size=12;fillColor=#ffebee;strokeColor=#c62828;fontColor=#7f1d1d;align=left;spacing=8;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="670" width="300" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#475569;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r0" target="r1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#475569;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r1" target="r2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#475569;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r2" target="r3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge6" value="account" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#475569;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r3" target="b1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge7" value="settings" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLo